<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfolio | [이름 또는 닉네임]</title>
    <style>
        /* CSS Reset & Base Styles */
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { 
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif; 
            line-height: 1.6; 
            color: #333; 
            background-color: #f8f9fa; 
        }

        /* 1. Header Section (Navy Background) */
        header {
            background-color: #0a192f; /* Deep Navy */
            color: #e6f1ff;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header-emoji { font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; }
        header h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: -1px; }
        header p { font-size: 1.1rem; opacity: 0.8; font-weight: 300; }

        /* 2. Main Content Section (Bright Body) */
        main {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: -40px auto 60px; /* Header와 살짝 겹치게 설계 */
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        /* Content Styling */
        section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
        section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        h2 { 
            font-size: 1.4rem; 
            color: #0a192f; 
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e6f1ff; 
            padding-bottom: 8px; 
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        h2 span { margin-right: 10px; }

        .info-list { list-style: none; }
        .info-list li { 
            margin-bottom: 12px; 
            display: flex; 
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        .label { 
            font-weight: bold; 
            width: 100px; 
            color: #666; 
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .interest-tags { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .tag { 
            background: #e6f1ff; 
            color: #0a192f; 
            padding: 6px 14px; 
            border-radius: 20px; 
            font-size: 0.9rem; 
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .goal-box {
            background: #f0f4f8;
            padding: 20px;
            border-left: 4px solid #0a192f;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* 3. Responsive Design (Mobile) */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header { padding: 60px 20px; }
            header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .card { padding: 30px 20px; }
            .label { width: 80px; }
            .info-list li { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
            .label { margin-bottom: 2px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <span class="header-emoji">🚀</span>
        <h1>[이름 또는 닉네임]</h1>
        <p>[경영학과 2학년]</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="card">
            <!-- 관심 분야 -->
            <section>
                <h2><span>🔍</span> 관심 분야</h2>
                <div class="interest-tags">
                    <span class="tag">유통</span>
                    <span class="tag">마케팅</span>
                    <span class="tag">창업</span>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- 좋아하는 것 -->
            <section>
                <h2><span>❤️</span> 좋아하는 것</h2>
                <ul class="info-list">
                    <li><span class="label">Item 01</span> 커피와 독서</li>
                    <li><span class="label">Item 02</span> 여행과 기록</li>
                    <li><span class="label">Item 03</span> 새로운 기술 배우기</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <!-- 목표 -->
            <section>
                <h2><span>🎯</span> 나의 목표</h2>
                <div class="goal-box">
                    "데이터와 마케팅을 결합하여 세상을 연결하는 가치를 만들고 싶습니다."
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>

